WEBVTT

00:03:58.609 --> 00:04:00.111
Is that wrong somehow?

00:04:00.111 --> 00:04:01.696
I don't think that's wrong.

00:04:01.696 --> 00:04:05.533
And also, is this little,
tiny negotiation that we're in

00:04:05.574 --> 00:04:08.703
really worth all of this fury
and rage and shame

00:04:08.703 --> 00:04:11.038
that I'm whipping up
and sending in his direction?

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:12.665
I don't think it is."

00:04:12.707 --> 00:04:16.627
So I did what any rational person
would do in this situation.

00:04:16.627 --> 00:04:18.838
I started crying, and I hid under my bed.

00:04:18.879 --> 00:04:19.880
(Laughter)

00:04:19.922 --> 00:04:22.425
And then, I started reading philosophy.

00:04:22.842 --> 00:04:25.094
And I started calling
philosophy professors

00:04:25.136 --> 00:04:27.096
and asking them to talk this out with me.

00:04:27.096 --> 00:04:28.723
And in the process --

00:04:28.764 --> 00:04:30.641
yeah, and they all, by the way, did it,